  <p>Thanksgiving is about warmth, family and gratitude — and the right balloon decor makes the table feel even more special. Think burnt orange, deep red, gold and cream: the colors of fall, done elegantly.</p>
  <h2>Ideas We Love</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Harvest garland</strong> — organic balloon garland over the dessert table or fireplace</li>
    <li><strong>"Give Thanks" centerpiece</strong> — warm-toned bouquet with a custom message balloon</li>
    <li><strong>Welcome columns</strong> — fall-color columns flanking your front door</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Keep It Classy</h2>
  <p>Stick to 2–3 complementary colors (for example, copper + cream + sage) and add natural touches like eucalyptus for a high-end harvest look.</p>
